@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed contract evolution and compatibility checks
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Identify owner, source obligation and actual consumers;\ninclude clients, workers, callbacks and stored payloads;
:Assess shape AND semantic changes;\nauthority, defaults, outcomes, ordering and effects;
if (Compatible with actual consumers?) then (demonstrated)
 :Verify old/new interaction and preservation checks;
else (breaking / unproven)
 :Define explicit version or coordinated transition;\ncompatible readers/writers and pending-payload handling;
 :Implement / verify coexistence and migration plan;
endif
:Evaluate actual candidate evidence;\nprotected history and external attempt meaning remain intact;
if (Evidence / disposition complete?) then (yes)
 :Promote reviewed contract;\nretire old form only under actual consumer disposition;
else (no)
 :Retain unresolved compatibility gate;\nrevise change or gather missing evidence;
endif
stop
@enduml
